  "problem": "What are the pivot columns of the matrix $B,$ given by\n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 2 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 3 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -4\\end{aligned}]?\n$$",
